 "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1769904400, "id": "26050662677892789", "version": "1.17", "version_code": 32, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24494518700173869", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25647114831580911"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794727693093339"}]}, "change_log": "1.16 UPDATE\n\n(Cumulative updates since v1.15.25 production release)\n\n\ud83e\uddff Passthrough: Enabled passthrough layers for selected levels and contextual interactions.\n\n\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Lobby Redesign: Rebuilt lobby with clearer UX, improved flow, and more legible entry points.\n\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Control Panel (DJ Deck): Simplified controls, removed low\u2011value features, and reduced cognitive load.\n\n\ud83c\udf0c New Scene: Added Blackhole \u2013 Mango Catch, expanding interactive gameplay variety.\n\n\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Sky & Atmosphere: Improved sky texture quality and visual coherence across scenes.\n\n\ud83e\uddec MorphQ: Refined topology and corrected UV mappings for cleaner deformation and shading.\n\n\u26a1 Performance & Stability: Ongoing optimizations across scenes following major architectural changes.", "created_date": 1765776952, "id": "25647114831580911", "version": "1.16", "version_code": 31, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25647113714914356"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary",